    <string name="peppy_sms_capture_enabled_label">Enable SMS sync</string>
    <string name="peppy_sms_capture_disabled_hint">Turning this off pauses new SMS capture and new sends. It does not cancel messages already handed to Android or discard pending requests and uncertain outcomes.</string>
    <string name="peppy_mms_capture_disclosure">Peppy encrypts downloaded MMS, including existing history, for sync through your configured server to your authorized vault devices. This includes message content, media and group-recipient data. Using permissions already granted, Peppy may read your SIM phone number even if MMS capture is off. Peppy syncs an encrypted copy for group-recipient matching. You can enter the number manually if unavailable. Carrier MMS itself is not end-to-end encrypted.</string>
